<title>USA: U.S. rice stocks in California on October 1-- USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. rice stocks in California on October 1-- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA reported U.S. rice stocks in California on October 1 (1,000 hundredweight):</p>
<p>			    ---ROUGH RICE----    ---MILLED RICE---</p>
<p>			   10/01/96  10/01/95    10/01/96  10/01/95</p>
<p>	     On Farm-X	N/A	 N/A	   N/A	 N/A</p>
<p>	    In Mills-X	401	 693	 1,069     1,149</p>
<p>     In Warehouses-Z    4,246     4,234	   Nil	 Nil</p>
<p> In Ports/In Transit	Nil	 Nil	   Nil	 Nil</p>
<p> Total All Positions    4,647     4,927	 1,069     1,149</p>
<p>X-Includes stocks in farm warehouses. Y-Includes stocks in attached warehouses. Z-Warehouses not attached to mills.</p>
<p>USDA said California rough rice stocks were down 6 percent from a year ago and off 55 percent from August 1 stocks.</p>
</text>
